            {
              "id": "7abf414a-f611-490e-a454-0c79035f2cba",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Replay: The History of Video Games</strong></em> was written by Tristan Donovan, published by Yellow Ant, April 20, 2010."
            },
            {
              "id": "e4ee8795-6a90-40e8-b18e-f7a304dda895",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "973d2d6c-ba98-4db6-8654-4b6d314d45d6",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>A riveting account of the strange birth and remarkable evolution of the most important development in entertainment since television, </em>Replay<em> is the ultimate history of video games. Based on extensive research and over 140 exclusive interviews with key movers and shakers from gaming's past, </em>Replay<em> tells the sensational story of how the creative vision of game designers gave rise to one of the world's most popular and dynamic art forms.</em>"
            }
          ]
